                <start-time>00:00:18,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:21,590</end-time>
                <translation>他在著作《存在与时间》中以人类的特征</translation>
                <original>存在と時間で彼が手掛かりにしたのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t torder="1" time="" id="" index="6" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:00:21,590</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:24,615</end-time>
                <translation>即“探寻存在的意义”为线索 重新发问
